Domain: grid-visit-all
Problem: grid-2
Require:
  :strips
  :typing
Type:
  object
  place - object
Obj:
  loc-x0-y0 - place
  loc-x0-y1 - place
  loc-x1-y0 - place
  loc-x1-y1 - place
Predicate:
  (= object object) :eq
  (at-robot place)
  (connected place place)
  (visited place)
Function:
Action:
  move: ?curpos - place ?nextpos - place
      pre: (and (at-robot ?curpos) (connected ?curpos ?nextpos))
      eff: (and (at-robot ?nextpos) (not (at-robot ?curpos)) (visited ?nextpos))
Init:
  (at-robot loc-x1-y1)
  (connected loc-x0-y0 loc-x0-y1)
  (connected loc-x0-y0 loc-x1-y0)
  (connected loc-x0-y1 loc-x0-y0)
  (connected loc-x0-y1 loc-x1-y1)
  (connected loc-x1-y0 loc-x0-y0)
  (connected loc-x1-y0 loc-x1-y1)
  (connected loc-x1-y1 loc-x0-y1)
  (connected loc-x1-y1 loc-x1-y0)
  (visited loc-x1-y1)
Goal:
  (and (visited loc-x0-y0) (visited loc-x0-y1) (visited loc-x1-y0) (visited loc-x1-y1))
Metric:
Pred prop:
  (at-robot place): in_init in_pre in_eff
  (connected place place): in_init in_pre
  (visited place): in_init in_goal in_eff
Func prop:
Global prop:
  is_unit_cost
